# Agent session state, and in particular `.claude/worktrees/` — a full second
# checkout of this repo. It MUST be excluded, and not for build speed: every
# entry above is anchored at the context root (Docker matches these with
# `filepath.Match`, so `node_modules` means `./node_modules` and NOT
# `.claude/worktrees/*/node_modules`), so a nested checkout's own sources sail
# straight past them into `COPY . .`. Measured: 4.13 MB of a second checkout's
# source was entering the build context, against 7.88 kB with this line — and
# `scripts/verify-image.mjs` check 13 is a byte-equality on what this build
# produces, so a build context that differs from a fresh CI checkout's is a build
# whose artifact is not the artifact CI pins.
.claude
*.log
.DS_Store
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
